    {
      "name": "dsh-lifeguard",
      "title": {
        "en": "DSH Lifeguard",
        "zh": "DSH 守护"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Turns the host's real crash logs into concise hard constraints: a static preflight before a plugin installs, a conflict check afterwards, a controlled self-heal when the harness will not start — plus handing a huge session over to a fresh one, with the brief written by a model that reads the original transcript and the original archived rather than deleted.",
        "zh": "把宿主真实崩溃日志沉淀成精简硬约束：装插件前静态预检拦崩，装完体检冲突，起不来时受控自愈；大会话还能转世成新会话，交接单由模型读懂原会话后写，原会话归档可回看，不删。"
      },
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/regrevia/dsh-lifeguard/main/icon.png",
